Third-party services and data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
dbt-costgate estimates BigQuery query costs exclusively via Google Cloud's
BigQuery API using dry-run jobs. It does not bundle or redistribute any
Google Cloud software, SDK data, or proprietary datasets.

The bundled per-region on-demand pricing table contains factual price points
sourced from Google Cloud's publicly published pricing documentation
(https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/pricing), recorded with a last-verified
date. Prices are facts, not copyrightable expression; the table is maintained
on a best-effort basis and is not a substitute for Google's official pricing.

